aken Academy is a melting pot of wacky personalities. In the Music Club alone you will meet pretty boy and lead vocalist, Vladimir, who struggles with keeping his hysterical fangirls at bay; ill-tempered bassist, Simona, always seen in her giraffe hoodie, who hates everyone (including you); and Broccoli Girl, the drummer, who just can\u2019t get over her ex.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e6fa318db72a94535b924e5cb019907d.poster.avif?t=1726270603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e6fa318db72a94535b924e5cb019907d.webm?t=1726270603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>So come on! Grab your uniform, lunch money, magical amulet and ignore the voice in your head that says this is a terrible idea!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e4c21c55f369d35a9b1be9a7dc8d81d3.poster.avif?t=1726270603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e4c21c55f369d35a9b1be9a7dc8d81d3.webm?t=1726270603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e4c21c55f369d35a9b1be9a7dc8d81d3.mp4?t=1726270603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Make friends, free spirits and make sure that the world doesn\u2019t end! Welcome to Kraken Academy, a technicolor fever dream that for legal reasons can only be described as &quot;technically a school.&quot; Join forces with a magical kraken to save the world!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe sharp writing has made me laugh out loud on more than one occasion, and I\u2019m enjoying getting to know these weirdos through sidequests and even dates.\u201d<br>Game Informer<br><br>\u201cKraken Academy!! is a heartwarming, outrageously hilarious and at times poignant adventure through time... I simply cannot recommend Kraken Academy!! enough.\u201d<br>9.5/10 \u2013 The Game Crater<br><br>\u201cKraken Academy was so much fun and was an enjoyable experience from start to finish... Overall, I loved, loved, loved this game.\u201d<br>9.3/10 \u2013 Lv1 Gaming<br>",
